        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>Try shopping for a USB-C cable and you\u2019ll be struck by the confusing disparities in cable pricing and performance claims. These are just cables, right? Can they really be that different?</p>\n\n\n\n<p>At PCWorld we\u2019ve used our share of USB-C cables and can say with total confidence that, yes, they really can. Big differences can arise in the construction quality of a cable and how it performs, whether you\u2019re talking about charging or transferring data.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our hands-on evaluation of numerous cables \u2014 ranging from the biggest, most-recognizable brand names to the cheapest of the cheap \u2014 reveals some clear winners.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For these USB-C cable reviews, we don\u2019t trawl consumer reviews like some \u201creviewers\u201d \u2014 we purchase the cables retail and test each one personally, examining how they are physically wired, the resistance, and the accuracy of the embedded",
